# Identify Bridge Cabinet for Corner Towers

This plan implements the logic described to correctly identify the bridge cabinet based on the `bridge depth`, `bridge width` (Total Depth - Main Depth), and `height`.

## User Review Required

Please review the proposed changes to `closetCatalogs.ts` to ensure it aligns with your expectations for identifying the corner bridge cabinets.

## Open Questions

- Does the API return the corner bridge catalogs (`CLB...` and `CRB...`) within the main `catalogs` array for the category (e.g., CAS), or are they returned separately? The plan assumes they are returned in the main `catalogs` array or that we can filter them out by checking if their codes start with `CLB` or `CRB`. 

